1
00:00:00,144 --> 00:00:05,987
Part 10 mein sales order ka poora safar: order book karna, chemist chunna,

2
00:00:05,987 --> 00:00:12,777
products aur quantity, special rate aur scheme, stock aur credit check, approve karna,

3
00:00:12,777 --> 00:00:15,620
reject karna aur status track karna.

4
00:00:16,565 --> 00:00:23,462
Orders screen par saare orders hain: portal, salesman, phone aur office se aaye.

5
00:00:23,462 --> 00:00:31,565
Upar filters hain: Open, Awaiting approval, Approved, Picking, Packed, Invoiced aur Delivered.

6
00:00:31,565 --> 00:00:37,945
Har order mein source, value, credit status aur current status dikhta hai.

7
00:00:38,613 --> 00:00:40,595
Naya order banate hain.

8
00:00:40,595 --> 00:00:42,232
Book order dabaiye.

9
00:00:42,232 --> 00:00:48,263
Chemist list mein filter kariye aur Lalpur Life Care Pharmacy chuniye.

10
00:00:48,263 --> 00:00:53,777
Turant uski credit limit, balance aur price tier dikh jaata hai.

11
00:00:54,432 --> 00:00:59,621
Add product box mein do akshar likhiye aur Enter dabaiye.

12
00:00:59,621 --> 00:01:01,351
Pantovista 40 joda.

13
00:01:01,351 --> 00:01:07,269
Is chemist ke liye Pantovista ka special rate 110 rupaye set hai,

14
00:01:07,269 --> 00:01:10,364
isliye rate PTR ki jagah 110 aaya.

15
00:01:11,029 --> 00:01:13,403
Ab Febrinil 650, 30 packs.

16
00:01:13,403 --> 00:01:21,713
Febrinil par 10 plus 2 scheme chal raha hai, toh Free column mein 6 packs apne-aap aa gaye.

17
00:01:21,713 --> 00:01:27,009
Scheme yaad rakhne ya calculator chalane ki zaroorat nahi.

18
00:01:27,661 --> 00:01:30,810
Teesra product Calvita D3, 10 packs.

19
00:01:30,810 --> 00:01:38,683
Prana company par extra 5 percent discount scheme hai, woh Disc column mein dikh raha hai.

20
00:01:38,683 --> 00:01:42,969
Stock column batata hai kitna maal available hai.

21
00:01:43,621 --> 00:01:50,781
Daayi taraf taxable value, discount, CGST aur SGST, round off aur total.

22
00:01:50,781 --> 00:01:55,058
Warehouse ke liye note bhi likh sakte hain.

23
00:01:55,058 --> 00:01:57,345
Ab Place order dabaiye.

24
00:01:58,010 --> 00:02:02,181
Order place ho gaya aur Awaiting approval mein hai.

25
00:02:02,181 --> 00:02:05,944
Credit theek hai, isliye credit status OK hai.

26
00:02:05,944 --> 00:02:09,379
Order kholte hain aur Approve dabate hain.

27
00:02:09,379 --> 00:02:14,614
Stock batch-wise reserve hua aur pick list godown ko chali gayi.

28
00:02:15,268 --> 00:02:17,757
Ab ek order reject karte hain.

29
00:02:17,757 --> 00:02:21,821
Kanke Road Medical Store ka portal order kholiye.

30
00:02:21,821 --> 00:02:26,799
Maan lijiye chemist ne phone par order cancel karne ko kaha.

31
00:02:26,799 --> 00:02:29,619
Reject dabaiye aur reason likhiye.

32
00:02:29,619 --> 00:02:35,592
Reject hua order kabhi bill nahi hota, aur reason record mein rehta hai.

33
00:02:36,252 --> 00:02:40,127
Approve hone se pehle order cancel bhi ho sakta hai,

34
00:02:40,127 --> 00:02:45,864
aur zaroorat ho toh line-wise quantity kam karke dobara order liya jaata hai.

35
00:02:45,864 --> 00:02:49,814
Approve hone ke baad stock reserve ho chuka hota hai,

36
00:02:49,814 --> 00:02:53,912
isliye badlaav ke liye cancel karke naya order banaiye.

37
00:02:54,564 --> 00:03:01,465
Har order ka status timeline mein dikhta hai: Awaiting approval, Approved, Picking, Packed,

38
00:03:01,465 --> 00:03:04,575
Invoiced, Out for delivery aur Delivered.

39
00:03:04,575 --> 00:03:09,656
Office ko kabhi phone karke poochhna nahi padta ki order kahan hai.

40
00:03:10,307 --> 00:03:14,068
Credit control order ka sabse zaroori hissa hai.

41
00:03:14,068 --> 00:03:21,199
Agla part poori tarah isi par hai: limit cross karne wale chemist ke order ka kya hota hai.

42
00:03:22,842 --> 00:03:29,346
Part 11 mein credit control: chemist ki credit limit, utilisation, overdue bills,

43
00:03:29,346 --> 00:03:36,974
hold aur block, ageing, aur ek practical example ki limit cross hone par order ka kya hota hai.

44
00:03:37,931 --> 00:03:41,794
Finance mein Credit control kholiye.

45
00:03:41,794 --> 00:03:50,593
Upar market ka kul outstanding, overdue, aur ageing ke buckets hain: 31 se 60 din,

46
00:03:50,593 --> 00:03:55,207
61 se 90, 91 se 120, aur 120 din se purana.

47
00:03:55,868 --> 00:04:03,406
Table mein har chemist: credit limit, balance, limit ka kitna percent use hua, overdue,

48
00:04:03,406 --> 00:04:07,046
sabse purana bill, status, aur risk score.

49
00:04:07,046 --> 00:04:14,584
Why column saaf batata hai ki risk kyon high hai, jaise limit se upar, ya dues overdue.

50
00:04:15,247 --> 00:04:19,902
Salesman, territory aur risk se filter kar sakte hain.

51
00:04:19,902 --> 00:04:24,126
Jaise Ravi Kumar ke chemists, aur sirf high risk.

52
00:04:24,126 --> 00:04:29,643
Isse har salesman ko pata chalta hai ki kisse vasooli karni hai.

53
00:04:30,298 --> 00:04:32,185
Ab practical example.

54
00:04:32,185 --> 00:04:40,722
Shree Ram Medical Hall ki credit limit 50,000 rupaye hai aur 45,000 rupaye pehle se baaki hain.

55
00:04:40,722 --> 00:04:46,383
Yeh chemist ab lagbhag 15,000 rupaye ka naya order de raha hai.

56
00:04:46,383 --> 00:04:48,630
Dekhte hain kya hota hai.

57
00:04:49,292 --> 00:04:54,692
Book order kholte hain, Shree Ram Medical Hall chunte hain.

58
00:04:54,692 --> 00:04:58,810
Upar credit limit aur balance dikh rahe hain.

59
00:04:58,810 --> 00:05:06,040
Telmiva 40 ke 120 packs jodte hain, jo GST ke saath lagbhag 15,000 rupaye hain.

60
00:05:06,693 --> 00:05:08,705
Place order dabaiye.

61
00:05:08,705 --> 00:05:13,834
Order ban toh gaya, par credit hold par chala gaya.

62
00:05:13,834 --> 00:05:20,271
45,000 plus 15,000 yaani 60,000, jo 50,000 ki limit se upar hai.

63
00:05:20,271 --> 00:05:23,993
Yeh order apne-aap approve nahi hoga.

64
00:05:24,648 --> 00:05:25,758
Order kholiye.

65
00:05:25,758 --> 00:05:31,152
Value and credit card par saaf likha hai ki limit cross ho rahi hai.

66
00:05:31,152 --> 00:05:35,038
Approve ki jagah Override and approve button hai,

67
00:05:35,038 --> 00:05:40,828
jo sirf owner ya manager ke paas hota hai, aur reason likhna zaroori hai.

68
00:05:40,828 --> 00:05:45,428
Har override audit trail mein naam ke saath darj hota hai.

69
00:05:46,081 --> 00:05:48,963
Hum yahan override nahi karenge.

70
00:05:48,963 --> 00:05:52,655
Sahi tareeka hai pehle purana paisa lena.

71
00:05:52,655 --> 00:05:56,437
Chemist ne 10,000 rupaye UPI se bhej diye.

72
00:05:56,437 --> 00:06:00,669
Collections mein yeh payment record karte hain.

73
00:06:01,316 --> 00:06:03,469
Ab balance 35,000 hai.

74
00:06:03,469 --> 00:06:08,460
35,000 plus naya order lagbhag 50,000 ke andar hai.

75
00:06:08,460 --> 00:06:12,765
Order par wapas jaakar Approve dabaate hain.

76
00:06:12,765 --> 00:06:16,288
Ab bina override ke approve ho gaya.

77
00:06:16,947 --> 00:06:19,055
Hold aur block alag hain.

78
00:06:19,055 --> 00:06:24,115
Chemist ki profile mein Put on hold ya Block kar sakte hain.

79
00:06:24,115 --> 00:06:29,596
Tupudana Rural Medicos par hold hai, kyunki do cheque bounce hue.

80
00:06:29,596 --> 00:06:34,571
Hold wale chemist ke naye bill bina override ke nahi bante.

81
00:06:34,571 --> 00:06:37,607
Block matlab koi naya order hi nahi.

82
00:06:38,258 --> 00:06:41,614
Licence bhi credit control ka hissa hai.

83
00:06:41,614 --> 00:06:48,495
Jis chemist ka drug licence expire ho gaya, uska order Medoro refuse kar deta hai.

84
00:06:48,495 --> 00:06:53,278
Isliye har chemist ki licence validity date sahi rakhiye.

85
00:06:53,930 --> 00:07:01,564
Credit control ka matlab bikri rokna nahi, balki sahi chemist ko sahi had tak udhaar dena hai.

86
00:07:01,564 --> 00:07:05,950
Isse bad debt kam hota hai aur cash flow sudharta hai.
